  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;cos&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;sin&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;cos&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;sin&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;cos&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;sin&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;cos&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;sin&#952;</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;cos&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;sin&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#960;cos&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;sin&#952;</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos&#952;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>But&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi></math>, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
